@startuml seq_generer_rapport
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #2C3E50
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF4FF
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #3498DB
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFAF0
skinparam noteBorderColor #E67E22

title Sequence diagram -- Report generation via JasperReports

actor "Admin RH\n(Angular)" as Admin
participant "analytics-service\n:8083" as AnaSvc
participant "Oracle 23ai\n(V_ALL_DEMANDES\nEMPLOYEES)" as DB
participant "Caffeine Cache\n(JVM)" as Cache
participant "JasperReports\nEngine" as Jasper
participant "Filesystem\n(exports/analytics)" as FS

== Phase 1: Report form submission ==

Admin -> AnaSvc : POST /api/rapports/generer\n{type:CONGES, departement:IT,\nperiode:{start:2026-01, end:2026-06},\nformat:PDF}
note right of AnaSvc : JWT role ADMIN_RH\ngrants access to all departments\n(CHEF role: own dept only)

== Phase 2: Data extraction ==

AnaSvc -> Cache : get("rapport_CONGES_IT_2026H1")
Cache --> AnaSvc : MISS (not cached)

AnaSvc -> DB : SELECT lr.*, e.first_name, e.last_name,\nd.name AS departement\nFROM LEAVE_REQUESTS lr\nJOIN EMPLOYEES e ON lr.employee_id = e.employee_id\nJOIN DEPARTMENTS d ON e.dept_id = d.dept_id\nWHERE d.name = 'IT'\nAND lr.start_date BETWEEN :start AND :end\nAND lr.status = 'VALIDE_RH'\nORDER BY lr.start_date
DB --> AnaSvc : List<LeaveReportRow> (32 rows)

AnaSvc -> Cache : put("rapport_CONGES_IT_2026H1", data, TTL=10min)

== Phase 3: JasperReports compilation ==

AnaSvc -> Jasper : fillReport(template="conges_report.jrxml",\nparams={departement:"IT", periode:"S1 2026",\nlogoUrl:"/images/synapse_logo.png"},\ndataSource=JRBeanCollectionDataSource(rows))

note right of Jasper
  JRXML template defines:
  - Header with logo and period
  - Table: name, type, start, end, days, status
  - Footer with page numbers
  - Group subtotals by leave type
end note

Jasper --> AnaSvc : JasperPrint (compiled report)

== Phase 4: Export and download ==

alt format = PDF
    AnaSvc -> Jasper : JasperExportManager.exportReportToPdf(print)
    Jasper --> AnaSvc : byte[] (PDF file)
    AnaSvc -> FS : save("conges_IT_2026H1_20260531.pdf")
    AnaSvc --> Admin : 200 OK\nContent-Type: application/pdf\nContent-Disposition: attachment\nbody: PDF bytes
else format = EXCEL
    AnaSvc -> Jasper : JRXlsxExporter.export(print)
    Jasper --> AnaSvc : byte[] (XLSX file)
    AnaSvc -> FS : save("conges_IT_2026H1_20260531.xlsx")
    AnaSvc --> Admin : 200 OK\nContent-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats...\nbody: XLSX bytes
end

note over Admin
  Browser triggers automatic download.
  File is also saved server-side
  for audit trail.
end note

@enduml
